  "title": "Turn State's Evidence",
  "storyCode": "GT-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "685a8272419135448fc6d0afd1e59f44d1cc9625902e34b9852b92294d34914e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "This one's limping! Take him out first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Grani! At this rate, we're all gonna be dead meat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Even if that's the case...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Quick! Take Carol and go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "I'll only end up slowing you down with this bad leg!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "I'll find a way to meet up with you later! Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "It's a promise then! Make sure to come get your share of the treasure!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "...Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Just go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "They ran away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "All right, who wants to play?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "...The sounds of fighting are quieting down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "But we can't afford to rest yet, Carol. Sorry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "I'm fine... But, Mister Bob... what about him...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "He might need some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Need some time...? Are you saying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Oww!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Carol! Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Sorry, I just tripped over this root..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Here, take my hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "...Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Can you walk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "We can only get in through the cave entrance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Mhm. Well, in that case..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Woah?! Was that an explosion going off in the distance...? Th-that can't be good..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Listen closely, there's the sound of screaming as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Someone's fighting. It's not over yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "...Carol, are you scared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "I'm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "...Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "But in order to protect my village and return peace to these lands... I have to do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "You're really brave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Anyway, let's keep moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
